        IAsset sell_,
        IAsset buy_,
        uint256 sellAmount_,
        uint48 auctionLength,
        TradePrices memory prices
@>  ) external stateTransition(TradeStatus.NOT_STARTED, TradeStatus.OPEN) {

```


### Impact
Since the `DutchTrade::stateTransition` modifier causes the `DutchTrade::init` function to always revert due to invalid trade status, no trade can be initiated on the `DutchTrade` contract thereby affecting the protocol's functionality.


