```
The owner might know that and can use such a delegation to interfere with the system by prohibiting of transferring/burning of his ids. This happens via _afterTokenTransfer() reverting as it's becomes impossible to reduce owner's votes balance by 1: 
[StRSRVotes.sol#L217](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-07-reserve/blob/3f133997e186465f4904553b0f8e86ecb7bbacbf/contracts/p1/StRSRVotes.sol#L217)
